  "knowledgeCaptured": [
    "S5 business rule: obligation, payment evidence/payment confirmation and reconciliation are distinct states.",
    "S6 synthetic controlled payment proved before/after and zero-residue cleanup.",
    "S7 renewal continuity distinguishes actionable renewable cases from historical review-only editions.",
    "E4 defects: year filter searches visible cell text; insurer-country segmentation uses client country; generic numeric aggregation sums policy identifiers; Mapfre cross-country mixing remains plausible but not yet proven.",
    "E8 current observations: Operativo can access Calidad; missing-data detection, country suggestions with provenance, financial-integrity review, and focused completion forms are observable; no write has been executed in E8.",
    "E9 controlled portal preview: legal gate, policies, payments, claims, documents, learning resources and notification surfaces are executable internally; no real external-client participant was used.",
    "E9 portal request forms route conceptually toward Ops; external WhatsApp/email remain dependent on connected channels; document upload explicitly declares Storage/backend dependency.",
    "Insights is analytically richer than Reportes and provides managerial views, but its figures remain supplemental until source/universe reconciliations are completed; it does not cure the E4 Reportes causal findings."
  ],
